        "notes": "Round 1. Take  [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e) it lets you trade some power in the first couple rounds for OP health later on. Deff the best thing to pick in round 1. try to land as many easy sleeps as you can. the extra health will make a big difference soon. target things like trapped ppl by junk for an easy sleep, or shattered enemies. or people sucked in by orisa.\n\nJust take  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) and  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)  round one. or if you have a zen  [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) can be worth it instead of  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318)\n\nPlay ana normally early. nothing crazy keep your tank up etc",
