        "notes": "Round 5. This round is where the only variable thing in the build is possible ill make it as simple as possible, \nif the opponent has a kiri, look at their first 2 powers they got before the round, if they got  [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) or the suzu ult charge power DO NOT take  [Venomous](item_594b0c79-5440-475c-b64c-c0295c46d735) here. it will only give her nonstop ults. instead go for  [Home Remedy](item_de68ba66-26d5-4136-a0c1-6396d3f1b0c7) and make sure youre only nading your own team unless you know kiri is dead. \n\nif kiris first two powers are the clone build. youre probably fine to take  [Venomous](item_594b0c79-5440-475c-b64c-c0295c46d735) \n\nNow not only do you have the crazy wp, you can crit, you have a lot of HP, have mobility with the  [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) . Nading the opponents will now kill them a lot of the time too, or if they are kiri suzu build, your nades giving overhealth is still great too!\n\nTake either  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) or  [Grenadius Pin](item_acd985cf-2e74-4e18-8fad-cdaa0837fc78) if you can afford it!",
